cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."

title: "BiOX Piezoelectric COMSOL Automation"

version: "v1.3.0"

type: software

abstract: >
  A reproducible COMSOL Multiphysics workflow for comparative
  BiOX (BiOCl/BiOBr/BiOI) piezoelectric modeling, including
  direct piezoelectric response, converse piezoelectric response,
  PFM simulation, and DFT-apparent parameter calibration.

